BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 696.89 Td (Aggregate: function reducing multiple rows to a summary, such as SUM or COUNT.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 679.69 Td (Alias: temporary name assigned to a table or expression in a query.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 662.49 Td (Anti-join: operation returning rows with no match, usually NOT EXISTS.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 645.29 Td (B-tree: ordered index structure supporting equality, ranges, and ordered retrieval.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 628.09 Td (Cardinality: count of distinct values or relationship multiplicity, depending on context.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 610.89 Td (CTE: Common Table Expression, a named result scoped to one statement.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 593.69 Td (Collation: rules for comparing and sorting text.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 576.49 Td (Constraint: database-enforced rule such as primary key, foreign key, unique, or check.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 559.29 Td (Correlated subquery: subquery that references a value from its outer query.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 542.09 Td (Covering index: index containing everything needed by a query.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 524.89 Td (DDL/DML/DQL/TCL/DCL: command families for definition, modification, querying,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 512.69 Td (transactions, and access control.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 495.49 Td (Derived table: subquery used in FROM.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 478.29 Td (Deterministic ordering: ordering fully specified so ties cannot change row sequence) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 466.09 Td (unpredictably.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 448.89 Td (Dimension: descriptive analytical entity such as customer, product, or date.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 431.69 Td (Fact: measurable event at a declared grain.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 414.49 Td (Fanout: multiplication of rows when joins encounter multiple matches.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 397.29 Td (Foreign key: child value referencing a parent key.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 380.09 Td (Frame: subset of rows around the current row used by an ordered window function.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 362.89 Td (Grain: what exactly one row represents.) Tj ET
