BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 328.49 Td (Index selectivity: how strongly an indexed value narrows rows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 311.29 Td (Inner join: returns matching combinations only.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 294.09 Td (Isolation level: degree to which concurrent transaction effects are separated.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 276.89 Td (Keyset pagination: fetch next page using the last ordered key rather than deep OFFSET.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 259.69 Td (Materialization: storing an intermediate query result during execution.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 242.49 Td (MVCC: Multi-Version Concurrency Control, serving snapshots from row versions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 225.29 Td (Normalization: organizing data to reduce redundancy and anomalies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 208.09 Td (NULL: unknown, missing, or not-applicable value; not zero or empty string.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 190.89 Td (OLAP/OLTP: analytical versus operational transaction processing workloads.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.30 Tf 0.080 0.100 0.130 rg 48.00 173.69 Td (Outer join: preserves unmatched rows from one or both inputs.) Tj ET
